{"id":"vod_sn_37405","vodId":"37405","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"美少女战士Crystal","name_cn":"美少女战士Crystal","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c6c536d605e7c24c5565fe032d6d8a61.jpg"},"summary":"据悉，在很早之前就有付出过动画化消息的《美少女战士Sailor Moon》，但是一直都没有相应后续的消息发布，直至今日，才刚刚发布了此作动画化的相关消息，据了解，其现在官方终于发布了新作动画终于迎来了开播日期的相关消息，已经确定《美少女战士》动画版将在今年夏季7月进行开播，敬请关注吧。　　动画化《美少女战士》官方称它将会于2014年7月在NICONICO动画网站中全球同步开播，这对于许多粉丝来说 ，绝对是一个非常好的消息，另外，大家之前就一直非常关注的动画制作如今也也公布了，其动画是将由东映动画负责制作的。而其动画的监督已经确定是在2009年参与过《ONE PIECE FILM STRONG WORLD》等杰出作品制作的境宗久担任，相信这个不会让大家失望吧。在系列构成方面，确定由小林雄次担任，此外，为此部作品献唱主题曲的如之前报道中所说的一样，是桃色幸运草Z组合。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WrgHkARt5v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aSiwdiajMG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/usx9VspF1N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cJaqehG4tc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/S6D3GavMHy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3KhcuZRrbd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b6nxkGNiwt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NAjDX8Dqxj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eZg0nS18ZU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2LMWhYbpcy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KN7iJ45D0N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q21UfQVzGy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wAa5ti6YZF1/vi